# GRUB SHIFT: SHOO sends every grub to a tile beside it (diagonals too), and
# a pit or a pod there is the end of it. MIST only takes free tiles. SEED
# drops a pod anywhere on the field and REWIND reaches any grub.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 1
cheat bug 0 0 1 0
cheat hole 1 0
cheat pods 1 1 1
cheat chip 6 40
cheat use 6 0 1
expect kills == 1
expect bugs == 0
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 0
cheat bug 3 3 1 0
cheat chip 5 34
cheat use 5 3 3 1 1
expect spent5 == 0
cheat use 5 4 4 1 1
expect spent5 == 1
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 0
cheat chip 4 24
cheat use 4 5 4
expect pods_at54 == 1
cheat bug 5 0 1 2
cheat chip 3 33
cheat use 3 5 0
expect lv_at50 == 0
